# Flutter does not load this file automatically. Prefer:
#   ./tool/run_dev.sh [deviceId]
# which reads backend/.env MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN (pk.*) → --dart-define=MAPS_API_KEY
#
# Manual dart-defines (tiles = public pk; never put sk / Directions-only secrets in the app):
#   --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3011
#   --dart-define=MAPS_API_KEY=pk.YOUR_MAPBOX_PUBLIC_TOKEN
#   --dart-define=MAP_ATTRIBUTION=© Mapbox © OpenStreetMap
# Optional override of Streets raster template:
#   --dart-define=MAP_TILE_URL=https://api.mapbox.com/styles/v1/mapbox/streets-v12/tiles/256/{z}/{x}/{y}@2x?access_token={key}
#
# Nest (backend/.env) — separate layers:
#   MAPS_PROVIDER=mapbox
#   MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=pk.…          # geocode / places / (same pk OK for mobile tiles)
#   ROUTING_PROVIDER=mapbox
#   MAPBOX_DIRECTIONS_TOKEN=pk.…      # Directions; can be same account pk with Directions scope
